      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2CH",
          "chapter": 25,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "The children of Judah carried away ten thousand alive, and brought them to the top of the rock, and threw them down from the top of the rock, so that they all were broken in pieces.",
      "ko": "유다 자손이 또 일만을 사로잡아 가지고 바위 꼭대기에 올라가서 거기서 밀쳐 내려뜨려서 그 몸이 부숴지게 하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "e3ea96c6e6641cbd7bd34805a32ce86176be095358b152267a1b19156bfa93a8",
      "translation_text_hash": "0c084fb4f6b4fd01b86668eb1deccc72e71d2bfe810db73872b987ace28679bf",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
