      "en": "But the men of the army whom Amaziah sent back, that they should not go with him to battle, fell on the cities of Judah from Samaria even to Beth Horon, and struck of them three thousand, and took much plunder.",
      "ko": "아마샤가 자기와 함께 전장에 나가지 못하게 하고 돌려 보낸 군사들이 사마리아에서부터 벧호론까지 유다 성읍을 엄습하고 사람 삼천을 죽이고 물건을 많이 노략하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "d5fa1df1d671b3053a66ff2578a4be13487a6b393125d3db58795e36c4b8930f",
      "translation_text_hash": "0705a1d4dc5730dd127b83824b37124c81eee7eedc8eedbe805d9d05d8342931",
