      "en": "So Joash king of Israel went up, and he and Amaziah king of Judah looked one another in the face at Beth Shemesh, which belongs to Judah.",
      "ko": "이스라엘 왕 요아스가 올라와서 유다 왕 아마샤로 더불어 유다의 벧세메스에서 대면하였더니",
      "source_text_hash": "2daba207492ac9e6873b663b3fe6544173f3f0936480a9a0c29bca38d61b9226",
      "translation_text_hash": "8683ee5c0466efba99380a6d8090d213148e06a87e4079b50fffb2748aeda13c",
