      "en": "Judah was defeated by Israel; so every man fled to his tent.",
      "ko": "유다가 이스라엘 앞에서 패하여 각기 장막으로 도망한지라",
      "source_text_hash": "5d1507f58ea116a0c71aecd043f4ac50bd420c22a8bd5506db3b6defb8369586",
      "translation_text_hash": "5f1b510a64b5106f4fcf7d0443096c20c4b1bb99e1614dfc4800e639de22f09f",
