      "en": "He took all the gold and silver, and all the vessels that were found in God’s house with Obed-Edom, and the treasures of the king’s house, and the hostages, and returned to Samaria.",
      "ko": "또 하나님의 전 안에 오벧에돔의 지키는 모든 금은과 기명과 왕궁의 재물을 취하고 또 사람을 볼모로 잡아가지고 사마리아로 돌아갔더라",
      "source_text_hash": "6f7b336a720fdb5c6cf1097ffa5ce4979bd3555790afdfbac3077489bfb7fc8e",
      "translation_text_hash": "2ff5509b8d1c2c80ea56aa267f4527432df2fb70413f1f3889446aec98247dce",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
